Topic: Individual Obstacles + Snake Race 🧗‍♂️🔥

👉 Today is about energy, courage & team spirit
👉 Here GTO checks your josh (enthusiasm) + stamina

1️⃣ Individual Obstacles (IO)

👉 You will face 10 obstacles
👉 Each obstacle has marks (1–10 points)
👉 ⏱️ Time: ~3 minutes

🧗 Example Obstacles
🔟 Common Obstacles
Jumping over wall
Rope climbing
Monkey crawl
Balance beam
Long jump
Burma bridge
🎯 Goal

👉 Complete maximum obstacles
👉 Prefer high-point obstacles first

2️⃣ Strategy to Perform
🔹 Step 1: Start Fast

👉 Don’t waste time thinking

🔹 Step 2: Target High Marks

👉 Try:

10 → 9 → 8 → 7 first
🔹 Step 3: Keep Moving

👉 If stuck → skip immediately

🔹 Step 4: Repeat if time left

👉 You can redo obstacles

🧠 GOLDEN RULE

👉 Speed + Courage = High Score

3️⃣ Snake Race (Group Obstacle Race)

👉 Also called Group Obstacle Race

🐍 Example Snake Race

👉 You will:

Carry a long rope (snake)
Cross obstacles as a team
Shout war cry
4️⃣ What GTO Checks
Team spirit
Cooperation
Energy
Leadership
5️⃣ How to Perform
✅ Do:
Stay energetic
Help teammates
Shout loudly (war cry)
Enjoy task
❌ Don’t:
Leave team
Stay silent
Act selfish
🧠 PRO STRATEGY

👉 Even if you are average physically:

💥 Your josh + teamwork can get you selected

6️⃣ Common Mistakes

❌ Fear of obstacles
❌ Low energy
❌ Not helping team
❌ Giving up early

7️⃣ Practice Task

👉 Start daily:

Push-ups (10–20)
Running (5–10 min)
Basic climbing/jumping practice

💪 Build stamina gradually

🧠 SECRET TIP

👉 GTO is not checking:

Gym body ❌

👉 He is checking:

Never give up attitude ✅
📊 Quick Summary
Task	Focus
IO	Courage + speed
Snake Race	Team spirit
Goal	Max effort
Secret	Energy + enthusiasm
